<title>JAPAN: Japan April housing starts down 9.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan April housing starts down 9.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in April fell 9.3 percent from a year earlier to 126,318 units, the Construction Ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>It was the fourth consecutive month of year-on-year declines.</p>
<p>					Apr starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			45,936	    -27.8</p>
<p> Rental homes			 44,429	     -3.4</p>
<p> Employee housing		    1,798	    -10.3</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   34,155	    +23.4</p>
<p>  Condominiums			21,051	    +36.3</p>
<p> Total				 126,318	     -9.3</p>
</text>
